----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The JDBC adapter in SAP Cloud Platform Integration (CPI) enables integration flows to interact with database
systems, allowing for data exchange and manipulation. Key points include connecting to various databases
(cloud or on-premise), handling JDBC drivers and data sources, and supporting SQL operations and
stored procedures. It also facilitates error handling and recovery, including fallbacks to backup databases.


